{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "GEN",
  "chapter": 46,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "GEN.46.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.46.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Israel took his journey with all that he had, and came to Beer-sheba, and offered sacrifices to the God of his father Isaac.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.46.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.46.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And God spoke to Israel in the visions of the night, and said, Jacob, Jacob: and he said, Here ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "am",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " I.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.46.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.46.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he said, I ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "am",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " God, the God of thy father: fear not to go down into Egypt; for I will there make of thee a great nation:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.46.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.46.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I will go down with thee into Egypt; and I will also surely bring thee up ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "again",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ": and Joseph shall put his hand upon thine eyes.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.46.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.46.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Jacob rose up from Beer-sheba: and the sons of Israel carried Jacob their father, and their little ones, and their wives, in the wagons which Pharaoh had sent to carry him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.46.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.46.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And they took their cattle, and their goods which they had acquired in the land of Canaan, and came into Egypt, Jacob, and all his seed with him:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.46.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.46.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "His sons, and his sons' sons with him, his daughters, and his sons' daughters, and all his seed brought he with him into Egypt.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.46.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.46.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And these ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the names of the children of Israel, who came into Egypt, Jacob and his sons: Reuben, Jacob's first-born.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.46.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.46.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Reuben; Hanoch, and Phallu, and Hezron, and Carmi.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.46.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.46.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Simeon; Jemuel, and Jamin, and Ohad, and Jachin, and Zohar, and Shaul the son of a Canaanitish woman.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.46.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.46.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Levi; Gershon, Kohath, and Merari.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.46.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.46.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Judah; Er, and Onan, and Shelah, and Pharez, and Zerah: but Er and Onan died in the land of Canaan. And the sons of Pharez were Hezron, and Hamul.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
