          "text": "These ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the sons of Leah, which she bore to Jacob in Padan-aram, with his daughter Dinah: all the souls of his sons and his daughters ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thirty and three.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.46.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.46.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Gad; Ziphion, and Haggai, Shuni, and Ezbon, Eri, and Arodi, and Areli.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.46.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.46.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Asher; Jimnah, and Ishuah, and Isui, and Beriah, and Serah their sister. And the sons of Beriah; Heber, and Malchiel.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
