      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.46.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Dan; Hushim.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.46.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.46.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Naphtali; Jahzeel, and Guni, and Jezer, and Shillem.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.46.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.46.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "These ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the sons of Bilhah, whom Laban gave to Rachel his daughter, and she bore these to Jacob: all the souls ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " seven.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.46.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.46.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "All the souls that came with Jacob into Egypt, who came out of his loins, besides Jacob's sons' wives, all the souls ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " sixty and six.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.46.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.46.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Joseph who were born to him in Egypt, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " two souls: all the souls of the house of Jacob, who came into Egypt, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " seventy.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.46.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.46.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he sent Judah before him to Joseph, to direct his face to Goshen; and they came into the land of Goshen.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.46.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.46.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Joseph made ready his chariot, and went to meet Israel his father to Goshen; and presented himself to him: and he fell on his neck, and wept on his neck a good while.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.46.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.46.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Israel said to Joseph, Now let me die, since I have seen thy face, because thou ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "art",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " yet alive.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.46.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.46.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Joseph said to his brethren, and to his father's house, I will go up, and show Pharaoh, and say to him, My brethren, and my father's house, who ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in the land of Canaan are come to me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.46.32",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.46.32",
      "verse": 32,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the men ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " shepherds, for their employment hath been to feed cattle; and they have brought their flocks, and their herds, and all that they have.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.46.33",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.46.33",
      "verse": 33,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And it shall come to pass, when Pharaoh shall call you, and shall say, What ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " your occupation?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.46.34",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.46.34",
      "verse": 34,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That ye shall say, The occupation of thy servants hath been about cattle from our youth even until now, both we, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " also our fathers: that ye may dwell in the land of Goshen; for every shepherd ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " an abomination to the Egyptians.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
